    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"meaningful\" stuff... i don't think i have any left in me. everything feels pointless. it’s not even that i'm bored, it's more like i’m just watching the clock tick and realizing there's nothing coming. i'm just sitting here in this cage i made, and the more i think about it, the more i realize there isn't actually a door. i'm just stuck.",
